      "URN": "urn:ogf.org:glue2:operations.access-ci.org:news:1013",
      "Subject": "Bridges-2 Migration Scheduled Downtime: November 9 Through December 2026",
      "Content": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dear Bridges-2 Users,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>This is a reminder that the Bridges-2 migration is expected to begin:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>November 9, 2026</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The system will be unavailable for approximately 4–6 weeks.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Key actions:</span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\" data-list-item-id=\"eaefb58e0541167e2025c48efaf27e210\"><span>Complete data backups by: November 1, 2026</span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" data-list-item-id=\"eb463973ee6e98cba1276e2dd4c92ab2b\"><span>Avoid delaying transfers—bandwidth is shared</span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" data-list-item-id=\"e2e8556778b2bcc88c87af074906c04f2\"><span>Ensure workloads do not extend into the outage</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>PSC cannot guarantee complete data integrity through the relocation. As a reminder, the Ocean filesystem is never backed up, so as a best practice, we strongly recommend our users maintain offsite backups of important data.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For full details, timelines, and preparation guidance, please visit: </span><a href=\"https://www.psc.edu/b2-migration-2026/\"><span>Bridges-2 Migration Information Page</span></a><span>  </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>As always, if you have questions about the migration, your data, or workload planning, please contact the PSC Help Desk at help@psc.edu. We are happy to help you prepare.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Thank you,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bridges-2 Team</span></p>",
